# @symthink/prompts

Open-source Mustache prompt templates + Zod schemas for Symthink. Full agent workflow: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). Human conventions: [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md).

## Layout

- **Source of truth for text:** `prompts/<domain>/<slug>/` (`meta.json` + `prompt.md` or `system.md`/`user.md`)
- **Variables:** `src/schemas/<domain>/<slug>.ts` (`definePrompt`)
- **Registration:** `src/external-chat/index.ts` or `src/symthink-api/index.ts` per `meta.json` → `delivery`
- **Never hand-edit:** `src/generated/` — run `npm run generate` after prompt changes

## Before finishing work

Run `npm test` (includes generate + domain README check + vitest). Use `npm run test:update` only when snapshot changes are intentional.

## Scope

- Prompt edits: keep neutral, sourced tone; fictional fixtures only
- Minimize diff: do not refactor unrelated prompts or build scripts unless asked
